        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur EADSWPLTT3, French Colonial Egg and Dart Triple Toggle Light Switch Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Triple Egg and Dart Toggle Switch Plate has a beautiful, traditional design that is perfectly suited for both historic homes and more modern ones simply from the finish color you select. The more authentic finishes such as antique pewter bring out the French Colonial look, making it a great restoration piece. Contemporary finishes like the bright chrome (shown) updates its look to fit into today's design trends. The Egg and Dart Triple Toggle Cover comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grandeur Egg & Dart Toggle Cover:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
